{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42727","headline":"和程刑部三首 碧鲜亭 · 王周","name":"和程刑部三首 碧鲜亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飋飋笼清籁，萧萧鏁翠阴。\n向高思尽节，从直美虚心。\n迥砌滋苍藓，幽窗伴素琴。\n公余时引步，一径静中深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}